flowchart TD
  A[Transport] --> B[Inbound adapter and metadata]
  B --> C[Inbox command]
  C --> T[Begin local transaction]
  T --> D{ConsumerId, EventId exists?}
  D -- duplicate --> N[No-op]
  D -- new --> H[Application handler]
  H --> R{Success?}
  R -- no --> X[Rollback and no ack]
  R -- yes --> I[Add Inbox completion]
  N --> S[Save once]
  I --> S
  S --> M[Commit]
  M --> K[Transport ack]
